### 대기열 진입
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/queue/enter
X-Loopers-LoginId: user1234
X-Loopers-LoginPw: abc123!?

### 대기열 순번 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/queue/position
X-Loopers-LoginId: user1234
X-Loopers-LoginPw: abc123!?

> {%
    if (response.body.data.entryToken) {
        client.global.set("entryToken", response.body.data.entryToken);
    }
%}

### 입장 토큰으로 주문 생성
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: user1234
X-Loopers-LoginPw: abc123!?
X-Entry-Token: {{entryToken}}

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 입장 토큰 없이 주문 생성 실패
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: user1234
X-Loopers-LoginPw: abc123!?

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}
